  "description": "With full suspension, a 27+ wheelset and carefully selected components, our Vice FS 2.0 is the ultimate ‘go to’ bike for ripping up the trails. Nothing will get in the way of your freedom with the amazing traction and control this premium machine offers.\n\nPlus bikes, or 27+ bikes continue to grow in popularity as the perfect mix between traction on the trails, and rolling resistance, to give riders greater stability and off road capability. The Reid Vice FS 2.0 takes this ethos one step further, adding front and rear suspension from Suntour’s premium Raidon range.\nThe frame is custom designed by Reid and frame gurus Kinesis. The Reid Vice FS 2.0 utilises the proven 4 bar Horst linkage system and offers 120mm travel for confident descents. Anti-squat kinematics also improve pedalling efficiency and energy transfer when climbing. It further features double and triple butted tubing, 12mm rear through axle, boost spacing and a tapered steerer to name just a few of the latest frame technologies on offer with this model.",
